  "ruleText": "Ed 1118.02 Eligible Offenders with Disabilities Incarcerated in State Correctional Facilities. An eligible offender with a disability incarcerated at the state correctional facility shall be eligible for services.\n\nSource. (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Ed 1100) #9197, eff 6-28-08; ss by #12141, eff 3-24-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ed1100.html"
